@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health (no sign-in needed)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health

### Register Account (the first account becomes the admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-BodyOps: 1

{
  "username": "rodas",
  "password": "change-me-please",
  "remember": true
}

### Login Account (the response sets the bodyops.auth cookie; the REST client keeps it for the next requests)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-BodyOps: 1

{
  "username": "rodas",
  "password": "change-me-please",
  "remember": true
}

### Me Account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Password Account
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-BodyOps: 1

{
  "currentPassword": "change-me-please",
  "newPassword": "change-me-again"
}

### Logout Account
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
X-BodyOps: 1

### Delete Account (asks for the password)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/delete-account
Content-Type: application/json
X-BodyOps: 1

{
  "password": "change-me-again"
}
